    simpleos_native_build_entry_closure_codegen_defects_2026-07-17, 1102, "2026-11-27 w2-4: extracted shard from bug_db.sdn matching BF-9 status; replaced remaining scalar .to_u32() C7 calls with `as u32` across gui_entry_desktop.spl, gui_entry_browser.spl, gui_entry_engine2d.spl, gui_entry_engine2d_virtio.spl, and gui_entry_engine2d_virtio_factory.spl; host x86_64_entry_u32_cast_contract_spec.spl 1/1 PASS and bf9_freestanding_init_and_u32_contract_spec.spl 2/2 PASS; QEMU waiting-for: sh scripts/os/build-simpleos-x86-64-desktop-engine2d-kernel.shs && sh scripts/os/run_simpleos_q35_smoke.shs and bin/simple test test/03_system/os/simpleos_native_build_entry_closure_spec.spl (with vfs skip lifted check for C8)"

